---
{
  "title": "Exact milestone or recognition name",
  "year": "2026",
  "kind": "Milestone",
  "summary": "What this recognition or milestone actually represents.",
  "featured": false,
  "order": 5,
  "draft": true
}
---

Optional image fields (add inside the JSON only after uploading the file to src/assets/recognition/):

- image: ../../assets/recognition/your-file.png
- imageAlt: a clear description of the badge or result shown
- imageLabel: View badge / View leaderboard
- imagePresentation: badge (inline artwork + proof link) or evidence (proof link only; default)
- url and urlLabel: optional clean public source URL and link text

Home shows up to four featured entries by order. Hacktoberfest-prefixed filenames also appear under Open source. Images are optimized automatically at build time.
